  "releaseNotes": "Fixes selection of pending Maliit composition and preserves the input context when focus returns from a menu. Adds opt-in TextClipboardBridge and ClipboardTextWriter for bounded Copy/Cut writes with exact ownership checks and protection against delayed deletion. Validated with 70 tests and physical selection/Cut/Paste on Fairphone 5, Click 0.1.5. Native Qt clipboard interoperability remains unresolved.",
